# nexora-action-code: get_power
Value Filldown SLOT (\d+)
Value Required POWER_ID (\d+)
Value Required STATUS (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Device\s+Info\s+on\s+Slot\s+${SLOT}:?\s*$$ -> DeviceTable
  ^\s*Slot\s+${SLOT}:\s*$$ -> Power
  ^\s*Slot\s+${SLOT}\s*$$ -> SimplePower
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$

DeviceTable
  ^\s*Device\s+ID\.\s+Status\s*$$
  ^\s*${POWER_ID}\s+${STATUS}\s*$$ -> Record DeviceTable
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$

Power
  ^\s*PowerID\s+State\s+Mode
  ^\s*${POWER_ID}\s+${STATUS}\s+${TYPE}(?:\s+\S+)*\s*$$ -> Record Power
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$

SimplePower
  ^\s*Power\s+${POWER_ID}\s*$$
  ^\s*State\s*:\s*${STATUS}\s*$$
  ^\s*Type\s*:\s*${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record SimplePower
  ^\s*Slot\s+${SLOT}\s*$$ -> SimplePower
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*$$
